// HAND OVERRIDES. One JSON object per line, and every line here beats the
// judged label in gate-labels.jsonl for the same hash, whatever rubric version
// it carries. This is how a person overrules the model without editing the
// judged fixture, and it is the reason a precision or recall number from this
// harness is arguable rather than asserted.
//
// To overrule a judgement: find its line in agents/scraper/fixtures/gate-labels.jsonl,
// copy the "hash" and "title", and add a line here with the correct verdict.
//
